test/fixtures/Makefile.section-anchors
#: stdout
== test/fixtures/Makefile.section-anchors
   1 . -   0  1 | ##@
   2 . -   0  2 | ##@------ Section 1 -----
   3 . -   0  3 | ##@
   4 . R   0  3 | undocumented-target: # does not consume the section
   5 . R   0  3 |
   6 . R   1  3 | ## The section is anchored to the next documented target
   7 . R   0  0 | t1:
   7 ========== => target:t1 +section
   8 . R   0  0 |
   9 . R   0  1 |   ##@------ Section 2 (spaces before the ##@ token) -----
  10 . R   0  1 |
  11 . R   1  1 | ##% A section anchored to a deprecated target
  12 . R   0  0 | t2:
  12 ========== => target:t2 +section
